{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t新清水灣道有校巴與巴士落斜期間相撞，7人受輕傷，包括校巴上兩名學童。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發在下午近4時，網上照片顯示，校巴撞向巴士車尾，校巴車頭損毀。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n運輸署表示，因交通意外，新清水灣道往龍翔道方向近彩興里的部份行車線需要封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車，上址交通繁忙。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.298248+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:06:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:02.491549+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:02.491549+00:00","content_hash":"1e1a68100afe9c3dbcc59089dbc31806d14486b0a5122007879b645843ecc920","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}